{"status":"completed","summary":"node1 now serves a persistent HTTP package repository from local storage. The tree package was installed from it while AlmaLinux’s BaseOS, AppStream, and Extras repositories were disabled. A reboot confirmed persistence and recovery.","actions_performed":["Created /var/www/html/alma-local containing the tree RPM and generated repository metadata.","Configured and enabled Apache to serve the repository at node1’s managed IP.","Created the alma-local DNF repository and disabled BaseOS, AppStream, and Extras.","Installed and executed tree-1.8.0-10.el9 from alma-local.","Safely rebooted node1 once and verified its boot identity changed.","Verified Apache, repository metadata, package data, and repository isolation after reboot."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Serve a package repository from local storage on node1","command_ids":["cmd-0129bbfeacb74586","cmd-f985726df9294dc0","cmd-bd8f5cb5c0c74147"],"summary":"The RPM and repodata exist under /var/www/html/alma-local; Apache serves repomd.xml over node1’s managed IP with HTTP 200, including after reboot."},{"requirement":"Usual remote repositories are unavailable during installation","command_ids":["cmd-f985726df9294dc0","cmd-bb31af234f904fbd","cmd-bd8f5cb5c0c74147"],"summary":"BaseOS, AppStream, and Extras are disabled. alma-local was the sole enabled repository during installation and remains so after reboot."},{"requirement":"Install a package from the local repository","command_ids":["cmd-bb31af234f904fbd","cmd-bd8f5cb5c0c74147"],"summary":"DNF explicitly installed tree-1.8.0-10.el9 from alma-local; the package and executable remain functional after reboot."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-4c99700b7a9f416c","cmd-a35c91fb33a14038","cmd-cf5599138d3f435d","cmd-bd8f5cb5c0c74147"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID f38484ef-a289-4d30-9a94-4ab42c44f900 was captured, reboot was acknowledged, and node1 returned with changed boot ID 3ca097e6-e7d7-45b6-bce9-af8b86854a35. Apache, HTTP repository metadata, local package availability, installed tree package, and disabled upstream repositories all recovered."}]}
